business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ku8cAVBLaF_4rI-yK6gNnQ","review_id":"h0M81xkZDxUCO3ZZq9GF0Q","date":"2016-12-22T04:23:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9449525475502014,"text_excerpt":"We went here for brunch on a Wednesday morning and even in the middle of the week, it was pretty busy. I recommend you make a reservation to avoid a long wait :) we tried the gumbo and for the main course I had the eggs hussarde dish. Both were fantastic. The eggs and the hollandaise were excellent. I say this because not every restaurant can make an eggs benedict dish well, but at Brennan's it was delicious. Most importantly, we ordered bananas foster. I loved that it was served tableside so we can see them flambé the dish. Better yet, the staff member shared the history of the bananas foster dish. Overall the food was delicious and the service was excellent. It's a pricey place but well..."},{"business_id":"ku8cAVBLaF_4rI-yK6gNnQ","review_id":"ezaSQy2msnbPjyySy-_svA","date":"2016-04-01T22:33:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9446282982826233,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! I urge you on your trip to make all efforts to come for breakfast or at least a cocktail in the courtyard. We loved it so much we came here twice when we were in town last month (breakfast and dinner). Breakfast was phenomenal- truly. The baked apple was perfectly browned and flavored. The rabbit is also superb- the best I've had. We of course also had the bananas foster for dessert - no matter how full you are -order it! (You'll thank me later) Our server was the right amount of attentive and friendly. He suggested great drinks and I had a great brunch experience. Dinner was slightly less magnificent, but one could blame us for doing Valentine's Day night dinner at this ..."},{"business_id":"ku8cAVBLaF_4rI-yK6gNnQ","review_id":"M03Wi62fPdub8SFxVT0_Hw","date":"2016-03-19T17:59:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9446166157722473,"text_excerpt":"Had breakfast at Brennan's. Was a little hesitant booking here given it appears so touristy til I read Brett Anderson's review recommending it, and that Slade Rushing is now the chef. The service was extremely friendly yet professional which made it a 5 star experience. The blue crab remoulade was great (especially if you like avocados). Had the Eggs Hussarde which was quite good albeit a bit pricey for what you get. It's an Eggs Benedict with marchand du vin which gives it a tangy bite. At breakfast you can also order lunch, and the grilled black drum with jumbo lump crabmeat was the best fish I had in New Orleans (and I ordered a lot of fish). Of course we had the table-side presentatio..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ku8cAVBLaF_4rI-yK6gNnQ","photo_id":"ImJl5NtsGKMero5KGIY7-w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ImJl5NtsGKMero5KGIY7-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8398607969284058},{"business_id":"ku8cAVBLaF_4rI-yK6gNnQ","photo_id":"vCrQBXaPtA-m62zVSsgwVw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/vCrQBXaPtA-m62zVSsgwVw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8200234174728394},{"business_id":"ku8cAVBLaF_4rI-yK6gNnQ","photo_id":"ljWhwffbTdMRNMtb26hZLw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ljWhwffbTdMRNMtb26hZLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.817579984664917},{"business_id":"ku8cAVBLaF_4rI-yK6gNnQ","photo_id":"0MJAAINJFdPVOq82E7B7CA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0MJAAINJFdPVOq82E7B7CA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.780029535293579